  "details": "Repro steps:\n\n- Download Mochie Standard\n\n- Set Screenspace reflections enabled\n\n- Set roughness to 0.5\n\n- Experience your FPS drop down to < 45 in VRChat\n\n-Now do the same, but roughness 0.0\n\n- It won't lag anymore in VRChat\n\nThis happened since the new graphics options were added.\n\nAdditional steps to check:\n\nRedo the same in older versions of VRChat prior to the Graphics option menu update.",
